        "author_name": "Rosanna Ciccarone",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115386152733441277869/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIQSlvJqmtsn34EnTsu8rUlvgYveArhIk9ZgwJdrld2C7Fy-A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "We were urgently looking for an architect/technologist for our plans. We found Hugo Castonguay online. Hugo was remarkably efficient, kind, and quick. His fees were also very reasonable.\nHugo was a great help to us.\nWe recommend him without hesitation.\n\nThank you.\nRosanna & Olivier",
        "time": 1599057799,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "linda st-amand",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101302274589491217376/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJeED-dN5ELPk_gg3lYcJ_68K1_eK1pkpDSmHY7Z3EDFM-GEQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Wow, an unparalleled experience. Hugo listened to us throughout the project. He gave us good advice and was able to reassure and guide us well. He was undeniably kind and efficient. Thank you, Hugo, for being by our side in this wonderful adventure.",
        "time": 1605818587,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Karima Gharbi",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113599994827188318129/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLaX5mjukzdqcSrZY0KS4xWMvU4gH0vB_A3-rep1UEneNGn3w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "I highly recommend Hugo Castonguay's services. Very professional service! Hugo was attentive throughout the process. His suggestions were well-tailored to our needs. He was able to deliver the plans within the agreed upon timeframe while offering good value for money.",
        "time": 1635203370,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Benoît Levasseur",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113878182858276358298/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI949wS4w7qkdBdYOq4toNdmsoF8S5IGM17gQwhp5ynaTk0kg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Hugo demonstrated exceptional professionalism and commitment to his clients. Extremely generous, he reassured us and implemented the necessary corrections quickly. Thank you for your support and insightful advice.",
        "time": 1613164448,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Claude Pinsonneault",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105190504072422797674/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLJwjCGMZ-5deSFFOqRwwHNoSEi0fChGaQxNbNuvNPFbJdn7g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "I just want to thank you and your team for the plans you drew up last fall.\nThis was my first time building a house.\nEverything went well, both with the foundation and the construction.\nYou quickly understood what I wanted and delivered quickly, which is not the norm these days.\nThank you again.\n\nClaude Pinsonneault\nSainte-Barbe",
